---
import BaseLayoutV2 from '../layouts/BaseLayoutV2.astro';
import EmailCaptureForm from '../components/EmailCaptureForm.tsx';
---
<BaseLayoutV2
  title="GreenSquare | The brief that survives senior scrutiny"
  description="GreenSquare gives Claude, ChatGPT and Gemini a rigorous process for one consequential business decision, from the first question to a clear recommendation."
  current="home"
>
  <section class="v-section v-off hero">
    <div class="v-container">
      <div class="v-split is-top">
        <div class="v-reveal">
          <h1 class="v-display">The brief that survives senior scrutiny.</h1>
          <p class="v-lead" style="margin-top: var(--v-6);">
            GreenSquare turns the AI account you already use into a rigorous decision process. The Decision asks
            the questions that reveal missing facts, compares the real options, and produces a clear
            recommendation with the assumptions and evidence behind it.
          </p>
          <p class="v-small hero-audience">
            For strategy, finance and operating leaders preparing a call for a steering committee, investment
            committee or executive team.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="v-btn v-btn--green" href="/decision-frame/">Get the free Decision Frame</a>
            <a class="v-btn v-btn--grey" href="/benchmark/">Read the benchmark</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="v-reveal d1">
          <div class="v-readout">
            <div class="v-readout__bar"><span class="v-readout__dot"></span> DECISION_BRIEF.md</div>
            <div class="v-readout__body">
              <ul class="v-spec__list">
                <li><span class="n">/01</span> The decision and why it matters now</li>
                <li><span class="n">/02</span> The options compared</li>
                <li><span class="n">/03</span> The recommendation</li>
                <li><span class="n">/04</span> The next actions</li>
                <li><span class="n">/05</span> What would change the recommendation</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="spec-tags">
                <span class="v-tag">given</span><span class="v-tag">derived</span><span class="v-tag">inferred</span><span class="v-tag">unknown</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="v-readout__foot">MARKDOWN OUTPUT <span class="v-cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="v-section v-fill">
    <div class="v-container">
      <p class="v-quote v-reveal">A sound recommendation starts with the questions that change the call.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="v-section">
    <div class="v-container">
      <h2 class="v-h2" style="max-width: 24ch;">What The Decision adds to the model.</h2>
      <div class="v-caplist">
        <div class="v-caprow v-reveal">
          <span class="v-index">/01</span>
          <h3>Find the facts that matter</h3>
          <p class="v-small v-cap-body">
            Short, focused questions come before the recommendation. The file checks the framing, plays the
            situation back, and asks you to resolve contradictions.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="v-caprow v-reveal d1">
          <span class="v-index">/02</span>
          <h3>Compare real options</h3>
          <p class="v-small v-cap-body">
            The model considers alternatives you may have missed, including keeping the current position, then
            compares them against the criteria that matter to the decision.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="v-caprow v-reveal d2">
          <span class="v-index">/03</span>
          <h3>Show the reasoning</h3>
          <p class="v-small v-cap-body">
            Important claims are marked as given, derived, inferred or unknown. The recommendation also states
            the assumptions it depends on and the conditions that would change it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="v-section v-green">
    <div class="v-container v-split is-reverse">
      <div class="v-reveal">
        <h2 class="v-h2">54 runs. The process held every time.</h2>
        <p class="v-lead" style="margin-top: var(--v-5);">
          We tested The Decision on Claude Opus 4.8 and ChatGPT GPT-5.5 across three business cases. The loaded
          file completed all five process checks in 18 of 18 runs and surfaced the hidden decision in 17 of 18.
          A question only baseline surfaced it in 0 of 18. The method and limitations are public.
        </p>
        <a class="v-link" href="/benchmark/" style="display:inline-block; margin-top: var(--v-6);">Read the full benchmark</a>
      </div>
      <div class="v-reveal d1">
        <div class="v-readout">
          <div class="v-readout__bar"><span class="v-readout__dot"></span> HIDDEN DECISION / 18 RUNS PER CONDITION</div>
          <div class="v-readout__body">
            <div class="v-run">
              <div class="v-run__head"><span class="v-run__name">QUESTION ONLY</span><span class="v-run__val">0 / 18</span></div>
              <div class="v-meter"><div class="v-meter__fill is-muted" style="--w: 0%;"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="v-run">
              <div class="v-run__head"><span class="v-run__name">ALL FACTS PROVIDED</span><span class="v-run__val">15 / 18</span></div>
              <div class="v-meter"><div class="v-meter__fill is-muted" style="--w: 83.3%;"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="v-run">
              <div class="v-run__head"><span class="v-run__name">THE DECISION</span><span class="v-run__val"><b>17 / 18</b></span></div>
              <div class="v-meter"><div class="v-meter__fill" style="--w: 94.4%;"></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="v-readout__foot">TWO MODELS / THREE CASES / JULY 2026</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-next v-green v-green-deep" aria-label="Get started">
    <div class="v-container home-next__inner">
      <div class="home-next__copy v-reveal">
        <h2 class="v-h2">Test it on a real decision.</h2>
        <p class="v-lead">
          Use the free Decision Frame to define the real call, surface the riskiest assumption and separate facts
          from guesses in about ten minutes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="home-next__action v-reveal d1">
        <EmailCaptureForm client:visible buttonLabel="Email me the Decision Frame" />
        <a class="v-link home-next__benchmark" href="/benchmark/">Read the benchmark and limitations</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayoutV2>

<style>
  .hero { padding-top: clamp(3rem, 6vh, 5rem); }
  .hero-audience { margin-top: var(--v-5); max-width: 58ch; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: var(--v-4); align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: var(--v-8); }
  .spec-tags { display: flex; gap: var(--v-2); flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: var(--v-2); }
  .home-next { padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 6.5rem); }
  .home-next__inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(25rem, 1.1fr); gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem); align-items: center; }
  .home-next__copy { max-width: 40rem; }
  .home-next__copy .v-lead { max-width: 48ch; margin-top: var(--v-4); color: var(--v-cream-soft); }
  .home-next__action { width: min(100%, 35rem); justify-self: end; }
  .home-next__benchmark { display: inline-block; margin-top: var(--v-4); color: var(--v-cream); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .home-next__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--v-8); }
    .home-next__action { justify-self: start; }
  }
</style>
